     "intro": "The Return of Mikkii is a classic beat'em up game. In it, the heroine Mikkii makes her way along the highway to the outskirts of a dark forest in search of a way home. There you will meet a gang of bandits who will want to engage in lust with you. The game is fully animated and made in 3D-format. The Return of Mikkii contains in-game fully animated H-content, including a Gallery that contains hot scenes in Full HD clips. There are a total of 12 clips in the game, not counting the 10 in-game sex animations, totaling 22 scenes."
